      "anchor_end": 141,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "You cannot believe that. I mean, so the tester in shortage, so we have to put\nmore CapEx in the tester or in the packaging or in other areas.",
