      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_2::BLOCK_0010::PART_01_OF_01",
      "source_text_digest": "948ad9fb0afcdf5c351f45800f7b0c6c660ab2b712b0e6ac9b4bb1deb62b5041",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_2::BLOCK_0010::PART_01_OF_01::CLAIM::18792E0C2248"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "c7aed6dcb92d1762892ce25716220f1d535e146578414eaeb7470b660fd1ee4a",
      "anchor_end": 218,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Due to the higher performance and more complex manufacturing process, HBM requires a higher number of wafers and more cleanroom space to produce the same number of bits as conventional DRAM in the same technology node.",
      "case_key": "MU",
      "evidence_item_digest": "f58f80446e30fde9413ff69d8fb408a34441b9717d459b6527fd33292cd582b2",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "c7aed6dcb92d1762892ce25716220f1d535e146578414eaeb7470b660fd1ee4a",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02::CLAIM::380D19B8C297"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "cb7d96d5c5b12c3cc148929870c66142096c198d4498c7cdfefe600a8c13a7f3",
      "anchor_end": 401,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "These barriers include achieving acceptable yields and quality for HBM products with their multiple chip layers, potential limitations on stacking additional 3D memory layers, increasing bits per cell (i.e., cell levels), meeting higher density requirements, developing advanced packaging solutions, improving power consumption and reliability, and delivering advanced features and higher performance.",
      "case_key": "MU",
      "evidence_item_digest": "f0a678580ff1cc4672238738d9bdcfe079437e2a80c7ba0bb2607a627196795f",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "cb7d96d5c5b12c3cc148929870c66142096c198d4498c7cdfefe600a8c13a7f3",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02::CLAIM::247B5D6D781C"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "fd98bd485a6a6e28c36db8ba209704a176ab38f8e50fdbd652a9726d6e6f0009",
      "anchor_end": 310,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "A disruption in our relationship with any of our top customers or a significant decrease in demand for our data center products, including due to disruptions or delays in the build-out of data centers by our customers and partners, or in the overall data center end market, could adversely affect our business.",
      "case_key": "MU",
      "evidence_item_digest": "2708563f1087ad11a8eed2e89bb54f04f0ced9a77055da64e3138145d3e34a51",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0012::PART_01_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "fd98bd485a6a6e28c36db8ba209704a176ab38f8e50fdbd652a9726d6e6f0009",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0012::PART_01_OF_02::CLAIM::1480D6B08277"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "5e7dcd2b8cb46a14f049e24dee212046a9b179886a33c067fcbf8141ae016cb5",
      "anchor_end": 336,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "The build-out of data centers by our customers and partners requires significant energy capacity, water, and capital, and any shortage of these and other necessary resources, any stakeholder opposition to data center development, or any delays in the build-out of data centers, could impact our future revenue and financial performance.",
      "case_key": "MU",
      "evidence_item_digest": "04758b1e66fb1e3401196367d2a5e90da0a949b0a39eeea70e63fabbefda6f72",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0012::PART_01_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "5e7dcd2b8cb46a14f049e24dee212046a9b179886a33c067fcbf8141ae016cb5",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0012::PART_01_OF_02::CLAIM::B1058930FF30"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "755bb9f583dc91243fb3d587382ecf24b3dc6a347eca5da5481ddec0632274b5",
      "anchor_end": 175,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Operating income increased $8.6 billion or 26%.\n•\nCost of revenue increased $12.7 billion or 45% driven by investments in AI infrastructure to support growing customer demand.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "97a2e472fd736f21febe1981dc697c0fa818c774035c3c6749485ab342ae87f5",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "MSFT_2026_10Q_ITEM2_BLOCK_0004_PART_04_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "755bb9f583dc91243fb3d587382ecf24b3dc6a347eca5da5481ddec0632274b5",
      "target_id": "MSFT_2026_10Q_ITEM2_BLOCK_0004_PART_04_OF_04::CLAIM::6E516A36099F"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "271ce08356c0eca70d21a6d80410bf36f5728af7445a717ef3a0f3e939943370",
      "anchor_end": 209,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Operating income increased $2.7 billion or 24%.\n•\nCost of revenue increased $4.8 billion or 47% driven by investments in AI infrastructure to support growing customer demand and increased GitHub Copilot usage.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "38d0de3f2bc797f66aac731c3468faecbab3a0eb65ee21e3537208462cc48ad9",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "MSFT_2026_10Q_ITEM2_BLOCK_0004_PART_03_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "271ce08356c0eca70d21a6d80410bf36f5728af7445a717ef3a0f3e939943370",
      "target_id": "MSFT_2026_10Q_ITEM2_BLOCK_0004_PART_03_OF_04::CLAIM::273A7F4CEBD8"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "de707c992c0cbb63e3b029d0bb0f8272003495aa51bc0c705f58ad04c1e9a026",
      "anchor_end": 181,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "•\nGross margin percentage decreased driven by continued investments in AI infrastructure and growing AI product usage, offset in part by efficiency gains across the Microsoft Cloud.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "e5935b4cad416dd3913af283de09d8a34ee67d6801732da0c5b5c0b88c3d10b8",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "MSFT_2026_10Q_ITEM2_BLOCK_0004_PART_01_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "de707c992c0cbb63e3b029d0bb0f8272003495aa51bc0c705f58ad04c1e9a026",
      "target_id": "MSFT_2026_10Q_ITEM2_BLOCK_0004_PART_01_OF_04::CLAIM::D8622E8D77F6"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "a72015501aba128d23f9ee29968ba12ee5b5d9810300454debaff28164bdda03",
      "anchor_end": 182,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "We have incurred and may in the future incur inventory provisions or impairments if our inventory or supply or capacity commitments exceed demand for our products or demand declines.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "a660bcbc6877e2fec4faddbc5253b38d3287a4af06546fe566f5d14446c3ad25",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "a72015501aba128d23f9ee29968ba12ee5b5d9810300454debaff28164bdda03",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04::CLAIM::505414424F51"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "62e89303dd766574b0da33b41266a91c058689c91c3c4dfcf862faef53eb9b8c",
      "anchor_end": 395,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "As of the end of the first quarter of fiscal year 2027, while we were able to ship uncontrolled products to China, such as gaming and workstation GPUs, we were effectively foreclosed from competing in China's data center computing/compute market, and our effective foreclosure from the China market helped our competitors build larger developer and customer ecosystems to challenge us worldwide.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "de30cb65df273e0fefa1ed03f86dd42f037af1badfb0b58369fe2e47fc3671ef",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0003::PART_04_OF_09",
      "source_text_digest": "62e89303dd766574b0da33b41266a91c058689c91c3c4dfcf862faef53eb9b8c",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0003::PART_04_OF_09::CLAIM::3D50DCEE7345"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "206abfd94e9293ff6d8f279f78b84e5a58027d79a4bfe1554677fc580b73ca39",
      "anchor_end": 262,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "The availability of data centers, energy, and capital to support the buildout of NVIDIA AI infrastructure by our customers and partners is crucial, and any shortage of these and other necessary resources could impact our future revenue and financial performance.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "23818a6ddac9267c73dd00016c249f5ce4e9d2b837cf67bdec1ab3f80094cdf9",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "206abfd94e9293ff6d8f279f78b84e5a58027d79a4bfe1554677fc580b73ca39",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04::CLAIM::37E8326CFAF7"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "ba808eff2eb5838ec311bd70f063324bdd231000d8a4725f49eb2fd6ad5769db",
      "anchor_end": 163,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Export controls restricting our ability to sell data center GPUs may also negatively impact demand for our networking products used in servers containing our GPUs.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "a59be866c727b4bba2d2248a34e7823d096372f1f454afce4fa59b13a9869d3b",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0003::PART_06_OF_09",
      "source_text_digest": "ba808eff2eb5838ec311bd70f063324bdd231000d8a4725f49eb2fd6ad5769db",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0003::PART_06_OF_09::CLAIM::149D366D355D"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "242abb3b2e605d6b714cb4490840545df41aa3b1d4d1297396c5e4e09d7803c4",
      "anchor_end": 127,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Extended lead times may occur if we experience other supply constraints caused by natural disasters, pandemics or other events.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "81434620b3d180bd82b774a0e730a48746b87147c2ed591467936df070e8f254",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "242abb3b2e605d6b714cb4490840545df41aa3b1d4d1297396c5e4e09d7803c4",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04::CLAIM::734ADB0F6364"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "312d16501d002162bff03722159c9d8bbc9dc966c6eacef72448c08db1deac6d",
      "anchor_end": 284,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Revenue was $81.6 billion, up 85% from a year ago and up 20% sequentially.\nData Center revenue was $75.2 billion, up 92% from a year ago and up 21% sequentially, driven by the ramp of our Blackwell 300 products and demand for our InfiniBand, Spectrum-X Ethernet, and NVLink solutions.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "71f0a3548e13d7acd710bcdf050263b32233673d69b1c4e66294ff0b38966850",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_2::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "312d16501d002162bff03722159c9d8bbc9dc966c6eacef72448c08db1deac6d",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_2::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_02::CLAIM::88615557BD56"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "294dd8e6e81e7d59f1c21fd57bfe615758ec74ad631141256ae251bf52b0d4a6",
      "anchor_end": 178,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "We continue to increase our supply and capacity purchases with existing and new suppliers to support our demand projections and increasing complexity of our data center products.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "28dc771b968ac7d78d0e25fe5f53102d747d6e9c358de7592aaab8f1701387a0",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "294dd8e6e81e7d59f1c21fd57bfe615758ec74ad631141256ae251bf52b0d4a6",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04::CLAIM::737D1ED96C17"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "7e2d2cbfc48592124e26671156588d2f77851dae6c6a9b5d2f7c4303b788d7cd",
      "anchor_end": 212,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "To secure future supply and capacity, we have paid premiums, provided deposits, and entered into long-term supply agreements and capacity commitments, which have increased our product costs and this may continue.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "f346d47e414f4d7514848525eab21baf5fcc9e172f5c7a2d1a4b6b184c2c9113",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_01_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "7e2d2cbfc48592124e26671156588d2f77851dae6c6a9b5d2f7c4303b788d7cd",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_01_OF_04::CLAIM::49A9739F5BF2"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "a8f11a54d01af6b3d318c2874d4ea455f4096aec014784c527ddf37b607a1011",
      "anchor_end": 141,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "We have also entered and may continue to enter into prepaid manufacturing and capacity agreements to supply both current and future products.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "be81dfed09119069710615a85b16226d4092f73dffd574776c46ae3430ce23d3",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "a8f11a54d01af6b3d318c2874d4ea455f4096aec014784c527ddf37b607a1011",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_02_OF_04::CLAIM::994A04877120"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "847763bb555f87afe39ed0ee2c2f7b21c9b631dcb2c60e0598c45507641e8e95",
      "anchor_end": 219,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Long manufacturing lead times and uncertain supply and capacity availability, combined with a failure to estimate customer demand accurately, has led and could in the future lead to mismatches between supply and demand.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "c0b7b7e8ad86bbc45b93191400d4f5b81d892d1576ed6b98f3944718953abce0",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_01_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "847763bb555f87afe39ed0ee2c2f7b21c9b631dcb2c60e0598c45507641e8e95",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_01_OF_04::CLAIM::A9CED4E938E2"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "8b741b81aa0629e31e3574ce906f7ec97c9080cb447c84cdd965f8c548a68d42",
      "anchor_end": 166,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "In periods of shortages impacting the semiconductor industry and/or limited supply or capacity in our supply chain, the lead times for certain supply may be extended.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "d2dcf83d175a3dff2696613167cb548ffe41643a74c0d4787b8a655816942bab",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_01_OF_04",
      "source_text_digest": "8b741b81aa0629e31e3574ce906f7ec97c9080cb447c84cdd965f8c548a68d42",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::NVDA::10_Q::0001045810_26_000052::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0002::PART_01_OF_04::CLAIM::764FE28B8451"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "c7aed6dcb92d1762892ce25716220f1d535e146578414eaeb7470b660fd1ee4a",
      "anchor_end": 218,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Due to the higher performance and more complex manufacturing process, HBM requires a higher number of wafers and more cleanroom space to produce the same number of bits as conventional DRAM in the same technology node.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "abe0e0f176e03b4bcbc2736c2dd60f58a59afcfe80815966b33b73e241b93940",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "c7aed6dcb92d1762892ce25716220f1d535e146578414eaeb7470b660fd1ee4a",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02::CLAIM::380D19B8C297"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "cb7d96d5c5b12c3cc148929870c66142096c198d4498c7cdfefe600a8c13a7f3",
      "anchor_end": 401,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "These barriers include achieving acceptable yields and quality for HBM products with their multiple chip layers, potential limitations on stacking additional 3D memory layers, increasing bits per cell (i.e., cell levels), meeting higher density requirements, developing advanced packaging solutions, improving power consumption and reliability, and delivering advanced features and higher performance.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "8cd6db95f19570d700b3cc75288ff962a7477d78e5eee4b89100eac574b366a3",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
      "source_record_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02",
      "source_text_digest": "cb7d96d5c5b12c3cc148929870c66142096c198d4498c7cdfefe600a8c13a7f3",
      "target_id": "CURRENT_DOC::MU::10_Q::0000723125_26_000015::ITEM_1A::BLOCK_0007::PART_01_OF_02::CLAIM::247B5D6D781C"
    },
    {
      "anchor_digest": "0fb9f788b2e84cc82eda20ce4b548d96d631eafda1bea6c9e8768a035dd94e3e",
      "anchor_end": 192,
      "anchor_kind": "structured_claim_text",
      "anchor_start": 0,
      "anchor_text": "Product highlights\n•\nHBM4, built on 1-beta DRAM technology, is in high-volume shipments for our lead customer's platform, and qualification samples have been shipped to multiple end-customers.",
      "case_key": "NVDA",
      "evidence_item_digest": "363e33781620f57f0ce9a030bb783804dead590a88ef1c5eb0de881f43d433e0",
      "review_status": "reviewed_exact_source_surface",
